{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Learning analytics for Lix puzzle-game"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:67926"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M. Vahdat"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Eindhoven University of Technology"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M.B. Carvalho"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tilburg University"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M. Funk"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Eindhoven University of Technology"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M. Rauterberg"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Eindhoven University of Technology"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J. Hu"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Eindhoven University of Technology"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"D. Anguita"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"University of Genoa"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"MV  Vahdat"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Eindhoven University of Technology"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>This study aimed to understand how people learn from games and serious games. Specifically, the aim was to collect data from gaming interactions to see if we can identify any patterns.<br>The experiments have been carried out with a group of 15 participants.  We asked them to play a short minigame of a game called Lix. Our data set contains the players' time series of activities during a gameplay. There are 15 CSV files containing the players' data per gameplay. Each file contains 11 features. The descriptions of the game, features, and actions are provided in separate txt files.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Use of this dataset in publications must be acknowledged by referencing the publication mentioned above (Relation).<\/p><p>This work was supported in part by the Erasmus Mundus Joint Doctorate in Interactive and Cognitive Environments, which is funded by the EACEA Agency of the European Commission under EMJD ICE FPA n2010-0012.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Computer and Information Science","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Learning Analytics; Educational Data Mining; Serious Games; Puzzle Games; Technology Enhanced Learning"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["English"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2016-01-01"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2017-01-17"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2017-01-17"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Lix is a puzzle game, based on Lemmings, which was a game released in 1990. Lix game is available here:  https:\/\/github.com\/SimonN\/Lix"]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Mehrnoosh Vahdat","Maira B. Carvalho"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["English"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D16000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D16500","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D50000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D67000"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D16000","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Computer science"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Informatica"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D16500","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"User interfaces, multimedia"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Gebruikersinterfaces, multimedia"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D50000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Gedragswetenschappen en onderwijskunde"},{"